{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Build ONE Shopify Online Store 2.0 section (single .liquid file) named "Bamboo Hero Banner" that recreates the attached reference banner. We'll build it in 6 steps; this is STEP 1. Return only the full code.
    
    RULES (apply to all steps):
    - Font: Montserrat ONLY (Google Fonts link, weights 300-800). No font_picker, no theme fonts.
    - Nothing hardcoded: all text, colors, sizes, weights, spacing, links, show/hide toggles are settings with defaults.
    - All text fields are richtext (CTA label is plain text). Single-line richtext: strip <p> with replace '</p><p>' with '<br>', remove '<p>' and '</p>'.
    - <strong> inside richtext uses that element's own bold weight and accent color settings.
    - CSS scoped to section id, prefix "mbh-", settings mapped to CSS variables. No JS, no external CSS.
    - Mobile below 750px, desktop 990px+, fluid clamp() in between.
    - Group settings with headers. Valid schema JSON, unique ids, add a preset.
    - Empty text or image: render nothing.
    
    STEP 1:
    Full-bleed section, aspect ~16:9, min-height setting (default 760px). Background image fills it (object-fit cover, focal point, srcset, eager-load checkbox) with an optional color overlay (default 0%). Separate optional mobile image. Fallback bg color #F3E9DD. Keep the center ~38% of the width empty (the baby is in the photo).
    Settings: bg_image, bg_image_mobile, bg_color, overlay color + opacity, eager_load, desktop height, horizontal padding (desktop 88 / mobile 20), content top offset (80), content max-width (560), mobile text align, margin top/bottom., STEP 2 of 6. Update the existing section; keep everything already built. Same rules as before. Return full code.
    
    Add a top-left text block (max-width 560px, left padding 88px, top offset 80px), stacked:
    1. EYEBROW: uppercase, letter-spacing 0.30em, 12px, weight 500, color #3A3A3A. On the same row, a thin line after the text (80px x 1px, color #8F8A80, 28px gap, vertically centered). Default: "Clothes for Little Tomorrows".
    2. HEADING (selectable h1/h2/h3/div): default <p><strong>Softer Days</strong><br>for a Brighter Tomorrow</p>. Regular part: weight 400, color #2B2B2B. Bold part: weight 700, color #4A5738. Size 64px desktop / 36px mobile, line-height 1.15, letter-spacing -0.01em, 24px margin below.
    3. SUBTEXT: max-width 470px, 18px / 15px mobile, weight 400, color #3A3A3A, line-height 1.5. Default: "Thoughtfully designed baby essentials in a breathable bamboo blend, for happy little moments and a kinder planet."
    
    Settings for EACH element: show toggle, richtext, size desktop/mobile, weight, color, line-height, letter-spacing, margin. Heading also: tag, bold weight, bold color. Eyebrow also: uppercase toggle, line toggle/width/thickness/color/gap.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign mbh_id = section.id | default: block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% style %}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }}{--mbh-bg-color:{{ section.settings.bg_color }};--mbh-overlay-color:{{ section.settings.overlay_color }};--mbh-overlay-opacity:{{ section.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by:100.0 }};--mbh-height:{{ section.settings.desktop_height }}px;--mbh-padding-desktop:{{ section.settings.horizontal_padding_desktop }}px;--mbh-padding-mobile:{{ section.settings.horizontal_padding_mobile }}px;--mbh-content-top:{{ section.settings.content_top_offset }}px;--mbh-content-max-width:{{ section.settings.content_max_width }}px;--mbh-margin-top:{{ section.settings.margin_top }}px;--mbh-margin-bottom:{{ section.settings.margin_bottom }}px;--mbh-eyebrow-size:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-eyebrow-size-mobile:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_size_mobile }}px;--mbh-eyebrow-weight:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_weight }};--mbh-eyebrow-color:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};--mbh-eyebrow-spacing:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}em;--mbh-eyebrow-margin:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_margin }}px;--mbh-line-width:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_width }}px;--mbh-line-thickness:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_thickness }}px;--mbh-line-color:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_color }};--mbh-line-gap:{{ section.settings.eyebrow_line_gap }}px;--mbh-heading-size:{{ section.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-heading-size-mobile:{{ section.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;--mbh-heading-weight:{{ section.settings.heading_weight }};--mbh-heading-color:{{ section.settings.heading_color }};--mbh-heading-bold-weight:{{ section.settings.heading_bold_weight }};--mbh-heading-bold-color:{{ section.settings.heading_bold_color }};--mbh-heading-line-height:{{ section.settings.heading_line_height }};--mbh-heading-letter-spacing:{{ section.settings.heading_letter_spacing }};--mbh-heading-margin:{{ section.settings.heading_margin }}px;--mbh-subtext-size:{{ section.settings.subtext_size_desktop }}px;--mbh-subtext-size-mobile:{{ section.settings.subtext_size_mobile }}px;--mbh-subtext-weight:{{ section.settings.subtext_weight }};--mbh-subtext-color:{{ section.settings.subtext_color }};--mbh-subtext-line-height:{{ section.settings.subtext_line_height }};--mbh-subtext-letter-spacing:{{ section.settings.subtext_letter_spacing }}em;--mbh-subtext-margin:{{ section.settings.subtext_margin }}px;position:relative;display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:max(var(--mbh-height),56.25vw);margin-block:var(--mbh-margin-top) var(--mbh-margin-bottom);overflow:hidden;background-color:var(--mbh-bg-color);font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif}
#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-image,#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-image{object-fit:cover}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-overlay{z-index:1;background-color:var(--mbh-overlay-color);opacity:var(--mbh-overlay-opacity);pointer-events:none}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-content{position:relative;z-index:2;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;max-width:var(--mbh-content-max-width);padding:var(--mbh-content-top) var(--mbh-padding-desktop) 48px}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--mbh-line-gap);margin:0 0 var(--mbh-eyebrow-margin);color:var(--mbh-eyebrow-color);font-size:var(--mbh-eyebrow-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-eyebrow-weight);letter-spacing:var(--mbh-eyebrow-spacing);line-height:1.4}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow-text{flex:0 1 auto}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow-line{flex:0 0 var(--mbh-line-width);width:var(--mbh-line-width);height:var(--mbh-line-thickness);background-color:var(--mbh-line-color)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{margin:0 0 var(--mbh-heading-margin);color:var(--mbh-heading-color);font-size:var(--mbh-heading-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-heading-weight);line-height:var(--mbh-heading-line-height);letter-spacing:var(--mbh-heading-letter-spacing)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading strong{color:var(--mbh-heading-bold-color);font-weight:var(--mbh-heading-bold-weight)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{max-width:470px;margin:0 0 var(--mbh-subtext-margin);color:var(--mbh-subtext-color);font-size:var(--mbh-subtext-size);font-weight:var(--mbh-subtext-weight);line-height:var(--mbh-subtext-line-height);letter-spacing:var(--mbh-subtext-letter-spacing)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-content>:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
@media(min-width:750px) and (max-width:989px){#mbh-{{ mbh_id }}{min-height:max(56.25vw,calc(var(--mbh-height)*.82))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-content{padding:clamp(48px,6vw,var(--mbh-content-top)) clamp(30px,6vw,var(--mbh-padding-desktop)) 40px}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{font-size:clamp(var(--mbh-heading-size-mobile),5vw,var(--mbh-heading-size))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{font-size:clamp(var(--mbh-eyebrow-size-mobile),1.4vw,var(--mbh-eyebrow-size))}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{font-size:clamp(var(--mbh-subtext-size-mobile),1.6vw,var(--mbh-subtext-size))}}
@media(max-width:749px){#mbh-{{ mbh_id }}{min-height:max(56.25vw,420px)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-image--desktop{display:{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}none{% else %}block{% endif %}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-image--mobile{display:{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}block{% else %}none{% endif %}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-content{padding:clamp(36px,10vw,var(--mbh-content-top)) var(--mbh-padding-mobile) 36px;text-align:{{ section.settings.mobile_text_align }}}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-eyebrow{font-size:var(--mbh-eyebrow-size-mobile)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-heading{font-size:var(--mbh-heading-size-mobile)}#mbh-{{ mbh_id }} .mbh-subtext{font-size:var(--mbh-subtext-size-mobile)}}
{% endstyle %}
<section id="mbh-{{ mbh_id }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
{% if section.settings.bg_image != blank %}<img class="mbh-image mbh-image--desktop" src="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}" srcset="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w,{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2400 }} 2400w" sizes="100vw" width="{{ section.settings.bg_image.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.bg_image.height }}" alt="{{ section.settings.bg_image.alt | escape }}" style="object-position:{{ section.settings.bg_image.presentation.focal_point | default: '50% 50%' }}" {% if section.settings.eager_load %}loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.bg_image_mobile != blank %}<img class="mbh-image mbh-image--mobile" src="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1600 }}" srcset="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w,{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w" sizes="100vw" width="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.height }}" alt="{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.alt | escape }}" style="object-position:{{ section.settings.bg_image_mobile.presentation.focal_point | default: '50% 50%' }}" {% if section.settings.eager_load %}loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{% endif %}
<div class="mbh-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mbh-content">
{% if section.settings.show_eyebrow and section.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}{% capture mbh_eyebrow %}{{ section.settings.eyebrow_text | replace: '</p><p>','<br>' | replace:'<p>','' | replace:'</p>','' }}{% endcapture %}<div class="mbh-eyebrow"><div class="mbh-eyebrow-text">{% if section.settings.eyebrow_uppercase %}{{ mbh_eyebrow | strip_html | upcase }}{% else %}{{ mbh_eyebrow }}{% endif %}</div>{% if section.settings.eyebrow_show_line %}<span class="mbh-eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.show_heading and section.settings.heading_text != blank %}{% capture mbh_heading %}{{ section.settings.heading_text | replace: '</p><p>','<br>' | replace:'<p>','' | replace:'</p>','' }}{% endcapture %}<{{ section.settings.heading_tag }} class="mbh-heading">{{ mbh_heading }}</{{ section.settings.heading_tag }}>{% endif %}
{% if section.settings.show_subtext and section.settings.subtext_text != blank %}{% capture mbh_subtext %}{{ section.settings.subtext_text | replace: '</p><p>','<br>' | replace:'<p>','' | replace:'</p>','' }}{% endcapture %}<div class="mbh-subtext">{{ mbh_subtext }}</div>{% endif %}
</div></section>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Bamboo Hero Banner","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Background"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"bg_image","label":"Desktop image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"bg_image_mobile","label":"Mobile image"},{"type":"color","id":"bg_color","label":"Fallback background","default":"#F3E9DD"},{"type":"color","id":"overlay_color","label":"Overlay color","default":"#000000"},{"type":"range","id":"overlay_opacity","label":"Overlay opacity","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":0},{"type":"checkbox","id":"eager_load","label":"Load images eagerly","default":false},{"type":"header","content":"Layout"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_height","label":"Desktop minimum height","min":400,"max":1200,"step":20,"unit":"px","default":760},{"type":"range","id":"horizontal_padding_desktop","label":"Desktop horizontal padding","min":0,"max":160,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":88},{"type":"range","id":"horizontal_padding_mobile","label":"Mobile horizontal padding","min":0,"max":60,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"range","id":"content_top_offset","label":"Content top offset","min":0,"max":240,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"content_max_width","label":"Content maximum width","min":320,"max":900,"step":20,"unit":"px","default":560},{"type":"select","id":"mobile_text_align","label":"Mobile text alignment","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Left"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"right","label":"Right"}],"default":"left"},{"type":"range","id":"margin_top","label":"Top margin","min":0,"max":120,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"range","id":"margin_bottom","label":"Bottom margin","min":0,"max":120,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"header","content":"Eyebrow"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_eyebrow","label":"Show eyebrow","default":true},{"type":"richtext","id":"eyebrow_text","label":"Text","default":"<p>Clothes for Little Tomorrows</p>"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"eyebrow_uppercase","label":"Uppercase","default":tru